# INVWINMF.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY: clicks between
# the split view's panes.  A click on a contents row while the tree has
# the focus moves the focus, the Record menu, the tool bar and the count
# to the contents.  A press on a tree row selects it, the box holding the
# mouse and the contents still the old location's; its release brings
# the focus back to the tree and, once the selection has settled, the
# contents of the location pressed.  The end by Exit.
# TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINMF.SNP is its snapshot; TEST/mousechk.py
# checks it.
T ADMIN
K TAB
T Retro1986
K ENTER ALT-L B
S LOCS
M 221.1 DOWN ROW 1
M 221.1 UP ROW 1
S CLICKED
M 208.1 DOWN ROW 2
S TREEDN
M 208.1 UP ROW 2
S TREEUP
K ALT-F X
